  "note": "The index assigns the noun in Psalm 5:3 to the verb key. The shorter noun is represented separately here under v.bv.ab. The title noble in Isaiah 32:5 and the disputed riches in Job 36:19 are already in yasha. Shoa’s name has no established connection to a cry. The Aramaic words for plastering and for a magnate do not substantiate the Hebrew cry."
